      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "v1 vs v2 at 1,000 products\nv1: 120 subs  ·  25 products/sub  ·  120 AmlCompute clusters/env\nv2:   9 subs  ·  334 products/sub  ·  3 AKS clusters/env\nCompute targets: 120 → 3 (per env)  =  13× reduction\nVM core quota raises: 120 × family → 3 per cluster",
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "v1 vs v2 at 1,000 products\nv1: 120 subs  ·  25 products/sub  ·  120 AmlCompute clusters/env\nv2:   9 subs  ·  334 products/sub  ·  3 AKS clusters/env\nCompute targets: 120 → 3 (per env)  =  13× reduction\nVM core quota raises: 120 × family → 3 per cluster",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.4
