      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "Endpoint-cap mitigation (334 > 100 default):\n1) Pre-file endpoint quota raise at subscription vend time  —  Microsoft routinely approves batch-only estates\n2) Multi-region: split products across Australia East + Australia Southeast (each region has its own 100-cap, giving 200+ per sub)\n3) Fallback: use 6 product-groups per env (18 subs) instead of 3  —  still 7× fewer than v1's 120\nAML Registry (per env): cross-workspace model + environment promotion  ·  DR failover without re-training",
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Endpoint-cap mitigation (334 > 100 default):\n1) Pre-file endpoint quota raise at subscription vend time  —  Microsoft routinely approves batch-only estates\n2) Multi-region: split products across Australia East + Australia Southeast (each region has its own 100-cap, giving 200+ per sub)\n3) Fallback: use 6 product-groups per env (18 subs) instead of 3  —  still 7× fewer than v1's 120\nAML Registry (per env): cross-workspace model + environment promotion  ·  DR failover without re-training",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.4
    }
